{"id":"n84261-2-7","stage":5,"title":"함께하다 · 相合","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84261-2-7-1","ko":"독립에 대한 사람들의 생각은 어때?","zh":"大家对独立这件事有什么看法？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"독립에","meaning":"独立","explanation":"독립：独立；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"독립","audio":"/audio/c7af673e11e6fbaf3346.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14759","senseId":"3","lemma":"독립","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"독립에","audio":"/audio/4bb278bf0a1c64a49c62.mp3"}},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대한","audio":"/audio/1d9b6fadeae799dde72f.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들의","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들의","audio":"/audio/b5de6ed0397d29c0e601.mp3"}},{"text":"생각은","meaning":"想法，念头，心思","explanation":"생각：想法，念头，心思；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"5","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각은","audio":"/audio/e50a186c9a1f2502e9a2.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c7af673e11e6fbaf","term":"독립","zh":"独立","audio":"/audio/c7af673e11e6fbaf3346.mp3","entryId":"14759","definition":"一个国家具有完整的主权。","pronunciation":["동닙"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想法，念头，心思","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"对某事持有意见或感受。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3515442c9eac4816fd4c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84261-2-7-2","ko":"우리와 뜻을 함께하는 동지가 점점 늘고 있어.","zh":"和我们志同道合的同志正在逐渐增多。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리와","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리와","audio":"/audio/64382219a150b5ef56cf.mp3"}},{"text":"뜻을","meaning":"志，志向，心意","explanation":"뜻：志，志向，心意；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"뜻","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43785","senseId":"2","lemma":"뜻","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뜻을","audio":"/audio/6edca8ad4570731d5389.mp3"}},{"text":"함께하는","meaning":"相合，相同","explanation":"함께하다：相合，相同；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"함께하다","audio":"/audio/cfbe25f214eb09b4652c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84261","senseId":"2","lemma":"함께하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"함께하는","audio":"/audio/5248d5a94f76b814262f.mp3"}},{"text":"동지가","meaning":"同志，同道中人","explanation":"동지：同志，同道中人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동지","audio":"/audio/0b774a2